### Crear un contacto
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alan",
  "lastName": "Krebs",
  "email": "alan@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "blue",
  "birthday": "1985-01-01"
}


